    "summary": "UNESCO's Member States adopted the Recommendation on the Ethics of Artificial Intelligence in November 2021, the first global standard on AI ethics. UNESCO supports its implementation with a Readiness Assessment Methodology used by more than 70 countries, an Ethical Impact Assessment tool, and sector guidance on AI in education (the 2019 Beijing Consensus, guidance on generative AI, and AI competency frameworks for students and teachers) and in courts and tribunals.",
